{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have you ever wanted a lively companion on your desktop? <strong>Your Sisters</strong> is an interactive desktop game that brings charming virtual sisters to your screen! Whether you're working, gaming, or simply relaxing, your sisters will always be there to keep you company. Watch them react to your mouse movements, explore your screen, and surprise you with adorable interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike traditional virtual pets, <strong>Your Sisters</strong> offers a dynamic experience where each sister has her own unique personality, animations, and voice lines and even customize their appearance, interact with them in fun ways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lively Desktop Companions</strong> \u2013 Your sisters move, react, and play around your screen in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Personalities</strong> \u2013 Each sister has her own quirks, animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interactive Fun</strong> \u2013 Drag them, poke them, or watch them respond to your actions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you need a cute distraction or just a bit of virtual companionship, <strong>Your Sisters</strong> will always be there for you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/611150?t=1744168267","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/611150/f2437d89d6edbd65d205d0a5f93c0539460ed29c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744168267","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/611150/c28c65444d29fa21397588063907cfb8be89b257/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744168267","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/611150/c28c65444d29fa21397588063907cfb8be89b257/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744168267","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have you ever wanted a lively companion on your desktop? <strong>Your Sisters</strong> is an interactive desktop game that brings charming virtual sisters to your screen! Whether you're working, gaming, or simply relaxing, your sisters will always be there to keep you company. Watch them react to your mouse movements, explore your screen, and surprise you with adorable interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlike traditional virtual pets, <strong>Your Sisters</strong> offers a dynamic experience where each sister has her own unique personality, animations, and voice lines and even customize their appearance, interact with them in fun ways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lively Desktop Companions</strong> \u2013 Your sisters move, react, and play around your screen in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Personalities</strong> \u2013 Each sister has her own quirks, animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interactive Fun</strong> \u2013 Drag them, poke them, or watch them respond to your actions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you need a cute distraction or just a bit of virtual companionship, <strong>Your Sisters</strong> will always be there for you!</p>","developers":["Team 35"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/611150/0587530454911c0440793e43a95118f6d6303029/header.jpg?t=1744168267","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118304,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118304/movie480.mp4?t=1744168266","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor